font-black uppercase tracking-widest bn:tracking-normal opacity-60">.env-এর key (সার্ভারে রাখা)</h3><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-bold border transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 border-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-800"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg>আবার পড়ুন</button></div><p class="text-[11px] opacity-50 mb-3">উপরের (এই ব্রাউজারে রাখা) key-এর পরে, .env-এর ক্রমে ব্যবহার হয়। .env-এ GEMINI_API_KEY_1, GEMINI_API_KEY_2 … লিখে 'আবার পড়ুন' চাপুন।</p><p class="text-xs font-bold opacity-40 py-2">.env-এ কোনো key নেই</p></div></div>"`;

exports[`SettingsApiKeys markup > renders the empty state (light, en) 1`] = `"<div class="flex flex-col h-full space-y-6 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar pr-2 [&amp;>*]:shrink-0"><div class="p-5 rounded-3xl border flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-slate-50 border-slate-200"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cpu w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20v2"></path><path d="M12 2v2"></path><path d="M17 20v2"></path><path d="M17 2v2"></path><path d="M2 12h2"></path><path d="M2 17h2"></path><path d="M2 7h2"></path><path d="M20 12h2"></path><path d="M20 17h2"></path><path d="M20 7h2"></path><path d="M7 20v2"></path><path d="M7 2v2"></path><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"></rect><rect x="8" y="8" width="8" height="8" rx="1"></rect></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest bn:tracking-normal opacity-80">Active AI Model</h3><p class="text-[11px] opacity-50 mt-0.5">Select Gemini model for transcription &amp; analysis</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><select class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border outline-none cursor-pointer focus:ring-2 bg-white border-slate-300 text-slate-800 focus:ring-indigo-500/20"><optgroup label="⚡ Super Fast &amp; Non-Thinking"><option value="gemini-3.5-transcribe">Gemini 3.5 Transcribe — অতি দ্রুত (Audio Specialist)</option><option value="gemini-3.5-flash-lite">Gemini 3.5 Flash Lite — সবচেয়ে দ্রুত (Fastest)</option></optgroup><optgroup label="⚖️ Balanced &amp; Smart Flash"><option value="gemini-3.8-flash">Gemini 3.8 Flash — দ্রুত ও আধুনিক (Default &amp; Latest)</option><option value="gemini-3.5-flash">Gemini 3.5 Flash — দ্রুত (Balanced)</option><option value="gemini-4-hydrogen">Gemini 4 Hydrogen — মাঝারি গতি (Gemini 4)</option></optgroup><optgroup label="🧠 Deep Thinking &amp; High Accuracy"><option value="gemini-3.1-pro-preview">Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview — ধীরগতি (সর্বোচ্চ মেধা) (Max Reasoning)</option></optgroup></select></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-3xl border flex flex-col gap-3 bg-slate-50 border-slate-200"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest bn:tracking-normal opacity-60">New models</h3><p class="text-[11px] opacity-50 mt-0.5">Shows the Gemini models your key can use on Google that the app does not offer yet (looking spends no quota).</p></div><button type="button" class="shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-bold border transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 border-slate-300 hover:bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg>Find new models</button></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-3xl border flex flex-col gap-4 bg-slate-50 border-slate-200"><h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest bn:tracking-normal opacity-60">Add New Key</h3><div class="flex gap-4"><input placeholder="Enter Gemini API Key (starts with AIza...)" class="flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold border outline-none focus:ring-2 bg-white border-slate-300 text-slate-800 focus:ring-indigo-500/20" type="text" value=""><input placeholder="Label (Optional)" class="w-40 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold border outline-none focus:ring-2 bg-white border-slate-300 text-slate-800 focus:ring-indigo-500/20" type="text" value=""><button disabled="" class="px-6 py-3 bg-p text-white rounded-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest bn:tracking-normal text-xs shadow-lg hover:brightness-110 active:scale-95 transition-all disabled:opacity-50">ADD</button></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-3xl border flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-slate-50 border-slate-200"><div><h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest bn:tracking-normal opacity-60">Test keys</h3><p class="text-[11px] opacity-50 mt-0.5">Each key is asked one tiny question on Gemini 3.8 Flash: it spends one of that key's requests for today.</p></div><button type="button" class="shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border transition-colors disabled:opacity-60 border-slate-300 hover:bg-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Test all keys</button></div><div><div class="py-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-30"><p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-widest">No Keys Found</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Add a key above to start</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-3xl border shrink-0 bg-slate-50 border-slate-200"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-1"><h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest bn:tracking-normal opacity-60">.env keys (kept on the server)</h3><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-bold border transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 border-slate-300 hover:bg-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg>Reload .env</button></div><p class="text-[11px] opacity-50 mb-3">Used after the keys above (saved in this browser), in .env order. Write GEMINI_API_KEY_1, GEMINI_API_KEY_2 … in .env, then press Reload.</p><p class="text-xs font-bold opacity-40 py-2">No keys in .env</p></div></div>"`;
